{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1111345-writing-in-the-trinity-continuum","id":1111345,"title":"Writing in the Trinity Continuum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-04T10:50:20-07:00","id":1111345,"title":"Writing in the Trinity Continuum","content":"How can I write stories in the Trinity Continuum? I wrote Hand of the Silver Mage a long time ago for Mage (Spring 2008 eQuarterly), but I really want to write stories in this universe. Or multiverse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T11:40:12-07:00","id":1111747,"title":"","content":"My thought would be to contact Richard Thomas directly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T13:28:11-07:00","id":1111793,"title":"","content":"Are you looking to write officially for the game, like in the books, looking to write material in the setting for profit but published outside the books, or looking to basically do some fanfic?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T14:58:33-07:00","id":1111824,"title":"","content":"fanfic actually. I would sell LITRPG Aeon stories on Amazon. That's not fanfic I guess. I am not sure how I would do writing game mechanic material.If I were confident with game mechanics I would apply. I still may after I practice game mechanics a bit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 07-05-2017, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T15:14:46-07:00","id":1111830,"title":"","content":"Well, there's fiction to be written for the game books too, not just mechanics. For that you'd need to use the Submissions guide on the main page here.<br /> <br /> If you want to sell it, it's best to contact Rich as noted above.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T17:44:27-07:00","id":1111908,"title":"","content":"Until or when we publish any sort of community creation guidelines or site for the Trinity Continuum, any publication that is set in the settings of the TC would be infringing on our copyright and unacceptable. Folks who want to write fiction and post it on their social media, without charging for it, are generally going to be OK, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T07:33:50-07:00","id":1112095,"title":"","content":"LITRPG fanfic is ok then. I can also try my hand with mechanics as I said before. Thanks all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T15:32:00-07:00","id":1125709,"title":"","content":"Would it be OK to write an Interactive Fiction game/story? No charging for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-06-2017, 07:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T18:19:05-07:00","id":1125749,"title":"","content":"